<title>POLAND: WARTA Q1 NET RISES TO PLN 8.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>WARTA Q1 NET RISES TO PLN 8.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Warta SA preliminary results</p>
<p>for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997     Q1 1996</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  8.62  vs    6.59</p>
